  [*] --> s0
  [*] --> s1
  s0 --> s2: the server answers the live offer / you discard or leave the page
  s0 --> s3: the live channel opens
  s0 --> s4: the 10 second connect timer fires / the live channel drops / the server answers the live offer
  s0 --> s5: the 10 minute cap stops it / you press stop
  s1 --> s6: you press the voice fill button
  s3 --> s2: you discard or leave the page
  s3 --> s4: OpenAI reports an error / the live channel drops
  s3 --> s7: the 10 minute cap stops it / you press stop
  s4 --> s2: you discard or leave the page
  s4 --> s5: the 10 minute cap stops it / you press stop
  s5 --> s2: the request times out / the server splits the speakers / the server transcribes the recording / you discard or leave the page
  s5 --> s8: the server transcribes the recording
  s6 --> s1: the browser denies the microphone / you press Escape
  s6 --> s9: the browser grants the microphone
  s7 --> s2: you discard or leave the page
  s7 --> s5: OpenAI completes a piece / OpenAI confirms the last words / OpenAI fails a piece / OpenAI reports an error / the 8 second finish timer fires / the live channel drops
  s7 --> s8: OpenAI completes a piece / OpenAI confirms the last words
  s8 --> s2: the 240 second abort fires / voice fill answers
  s9 --> s1: the 40 minute cap stops it / you press Escape / you press stop
